    "title": "Fairfax City Korean BBQ restaurant expanding to Greenbriar Town Center - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mary Stachyra Lopez ,\n1 days ago A popular Korean BBQ restaurant in Fairfax City is making plans to expand to Greenbriar Town Center this year. Construction on Meokja Meokja’s second location at 13041 Lee Jackson Memorial Highway just outside Chantilly should be completed sometime between March and May, staff told FFXnow during a recent busy dinner shift. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
